<section class="basilar-launch" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <div><small>INTERACTIVE / 基底膜实验室</small><h2>看声音，沿基底膜展开。</h2><p>载入本地声音，或使用麦克风。旋转三维膜面，比较不同声音的响应位置、通道输出与包络。</p><a href={url('lab/basilar-membrane')}>打开基底膜 3D 仿真 →</a><p><small>本地处理 · 纯音与双音演示 · 教学滤波器组模型</small></p></div>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 360 150" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="#81e6d9" stroke-width="2"><path d="M10 125 Q100 125 140 60 T210 100 T350 125"/><path d="M10 105 Q100 105 140 40 T210 80 T350 105"/><path d="M10 85 Q100 85 140 20 T210 60 T350 85"/><path d="M10 65 Q100 65 140 0 T210 40 T350 65"/></g></svg>
</section>
<style>.basilar-launch{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:30px;padding:28px;margin:24px 0 36px;border-radius:12px;background:#102c40;color:#eaf8ff}.basilar-launch h2{font-size:24px;color:#fff;margin:12px 0}.basilar-launch p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.9}.basilar-launch small{color:#95c6d5;font-size:11px}.basilar-launch a{display:inline-block;background:#9ce5d2;color:#102c40;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:6px;margin-top:14px;font-weight:600}.basilar-launch svg{width:32%;flex-shrink:0}@media(max-width:650px){.basilar-launch{padding:20px}.basilar-launch svg{display:none}}</style>
